SUMMARY:SABRGLB — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: SABRE FINL BORROWER LLC (SABRGLB)\nRoadshow: https://www.netroadsh
 ow.com/events/login/1PeTHmojJaYUyuwEwf9tv96JReW237XdJryvA\n\nDeal context:
 \nSabre Financial Borrower\, LLC (NASDAQ: SABR\, market cap $876mm) is bri
 nging a $1\,100 million Senior Secured Notes offering with a 6-year tenor 
 (maturing 2032)\, structured as a 'double-dip' security where the notes ar
 e secured by a pledge of intercompany loan receivables from Sabre GLBL (pa
 ri passu first lien with existing Sabre GLBL debt) plus $400 million in se
 cured guarantees from foreign subsidiaries. The deal features an NC-3 stru
 cture with a first call at par plus 50% of coupon\, a 40% equity claw\, an
 d a 101% change of control put\, with proceeds intended to fund an interco
 mpany loan to Sabre GLBL to repay existing indebtedness. Joint bookrunners
  BofA and Citi are running the deal\, with an investor call scheduled for 
 September 14th at 10:30 AM ET and expected pricing the following day (Sept
 ember 15\, 2026).
